# http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000417
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000417> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000417> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "inverse of the relation of is quality measurement of"@en .
