# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025006
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025006> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025006> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "process attribute of"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025006> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A relation between a process attribute and a process, which \"bears\" the attribute."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025006> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Tensile rate is a process attribute of tensile test"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025013
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025013> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025013> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000015> .
