_:genid73 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000035> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> _:genid74 .
_:genid74 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> _:genid75 .
_:genid75 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#unionOf> _:genid77 .
