<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_23116> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_25585> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_23116> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "chlorine atom" .
