# http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_23367
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_23367> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_23367> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_24431> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_23367> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "Any constitutionally or isotopically distinct atom, molecule, ion, ion pair, radical, radical ion, complex, conformer etc., identifiable as a separately distinguishable entity." .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_23367> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "molecular entity" .
