<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_24061> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_25585> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_24061> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "fluorine atom" .
