# http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_24431
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_24431> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
