<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000027> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "An information content entity that is intended to be a truthful statement about something (modulo, e.g., measurement precision or other systematic errors) and is constructed/acquired by a method which reliably tends to produce (approximately) truthful statements."@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000027> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "An information content entity that is intended to be one or more truthful statement(s) about something (modulo, e.g., measurement precision or other systematic errors) and is constructed/acquired by a method which reliably tends to produce (approximately) truthful statements."@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000027> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "data entity"@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000027> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "data item"@en .
