# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010063
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010063> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010063> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000030> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010063> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "best treatment techniques"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010063> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "bestTreatmentTechniques"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010063> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An information content entity that recommends preferred treatment techniques for a dismantled product, component, or material in a given circular economy scenario."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010063> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A recommendation to remove electronics before shredding a polymer-rich component."@en .
