# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010064
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010064> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010064> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000010> .
