<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010093> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An identifier assigned to an individual vehicle according to a vehicle identification number scheme."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010093> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A 17-character vehicle identification number used in a dismantling record."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010094
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010094> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
