<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010095> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An information content entity that aggregates identifiers, specifications, usage data, condition data, or circular economy information about a component."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010095> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A component record containing part number, material designation, mileage, and reuse assessment."@en .
