<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010097> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "component age (Alter der Komponente)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010097> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A temporal interval that extends from a stated component reference event to a stated observation event."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010097> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A component age of six years measured from vehicle production date to dismantling date."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010098
