<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010106> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "MaterialClass"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010106> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "material class and composition"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010106> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An information content entity that assigns a material, component, or product to a material category in a stated classification scheme."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010106> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A VDA 231-106 material class assignment for polymer materials."@en .
