<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010128> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A material entity produced from virgin raw resources and used for the first time in a production process."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010128> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Virgin PA66 resin produced from primary chemical feedstocks."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010129
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010129> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010129> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0040001> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010129> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "physical dimension"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010129> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A quality that characterizes a physical extent or dimensional feature of a material entity, product, component, or geometric feature."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010129> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Length, width, thickness, or diameter used to characterize an automotive component."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010131
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010131> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010131> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000618> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010131> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Expected value datatype: xsd:float; expected unit: GPa."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010131> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "young's modulus"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010131> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "youngs modulus"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010131> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An elastic modulus that quantifies the ratio of uniaxial stress to uniaxial strain in the linear elastic region of a material response."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010131> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "9.5 GPa Young's modulus for PA66-GF30 measured by tensile testing."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010140
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010140> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010140> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000027> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010140> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "unusual properties"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010140> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A data item that records noteworthy, unexpected, or abnormal properties observed for a component during use, inspection, dismantling, or circular economy assessment."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010140> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A note that a component shows unusual discoloration or deformation compared with its expected state."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010141
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010141> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010141> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000202> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010141> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "actual dismantling time"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010141> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A temporal interval occupied by an observed dismantling process for a product, vehicle, or component."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010141> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "The measured time in minutes to remove a component from an end-of-life vehicle."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010142
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010142> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010142> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000030> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010142> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "selected r-strategy rationale"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010142> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "reason for selected r-strategy"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010142> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An information content entity that states the rationale for selecting a reuse, repair, remanufacturing, recycling, recovery, or disposal strategy for a product or component."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010142> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A reason stating that reuse was rejected because mounting points were broken."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010143
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010143> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010143> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000033> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010143> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "selected r-strategy"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010143> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A directive information entity that specifies the circular economy strategy selected for a product or component."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010143> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A selected strategy of reuse, recycling, or remanufacturing for a dismantled component."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010144
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010144> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010144> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010060> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010144> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "actual dismantlability"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010144> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A disposition assessment that records how dismantlable a product or component was in an observed dismantling event."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010144> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "An actual dismantlability assessment from a dismantler after removing a door module."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010145
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010145> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010145> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0001933> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010145> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Expected value datatype: xsd:float; expected unit: kg CO2e."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010145> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "selected r-strategy carbon footprint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010145> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "actual footprint of chosen r-strategy"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010145> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A product carbon footprint that specifies the greenhouse gas emissions of the selected circular economy strategy for a component."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010145> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "3.2 kg CO2e resulting from choosing reuse for a dismantled component."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010146
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010146> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
