<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010147> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A quality of a vehicle that classifies its propulsion architecture or drive configuration."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010147> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Battery electric drive, hybrid drive, or combustion engine drive."@en .
