<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010149> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A quality of a vehicle that classifies the vehicle according to its design, construction, or intended purpose."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010149> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Passenger car, light commercial vehicle, or heavy truck."@en .
