<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010160> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "An original equipment manufacturer project code used to identify a vehicle model in product data."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010161
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010161> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
