<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010162> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A manufacturer that designs or produces the original vehicle, component, or system for which circular economy data is recorded."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010162> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A vehicle manufacturer recorded as the original equipment manufacturer for a vehicle series."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010163
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010163> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010163> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0001044> .
