<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010175> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A batch of polymer granulate produced under one manufacturing order."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010176
