# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010195
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010195> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010195> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/log/LOG_1000023> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010195> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "recycling batch operator"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010195> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "operator"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010195> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A supply chain agent that operates a transport, treatment, or recycling process for a recycling batch."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010195> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "The company operating the transport process for a recycling batch."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010196
