<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010196> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "actor number"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010196> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An identifier assigned to an actor in a recycling, logistics, or supply-chain process."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010196> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "An operating number used to identify a recycling batch actor."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010197
