<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Sender, receiver, recycler, operator, or transporter recorded as an actor role type."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010198
