<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010220> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A recycling process that recovers material through mechanical operations without intentional chemical depolymerization."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010220> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Sorting, shredding, washing, and regranulating polymer parts."@en .
