# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010224
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010224> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010224> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000310> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010224> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "weighing slip"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010224> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A document that records the result of weighing materials, components, products, or recycling batches."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010224> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A weighing slip issued by a scale during intake of a recycling batch."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010225
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010225> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010225> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000030> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010225> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "measurement type"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010225> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An information content entity that classifies the measurement method or instrument used to obtain a value."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010225> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Material scale recorded as the measurement type for a mass determination."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010226
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010226> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010226> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0001044> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010226> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Expected value datatype: xsd:dateTime; expected unit: not specified."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010226> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "measurement timestamp"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010226> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A date value specification that records the time at which a measurement was made."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010226> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "2024-01-01T14:23:00+01:00 recorded as a measurement timestamp."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010227
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010227> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010227> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0001044> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010227> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Expected value datatype: xsd:dateTime; expected unit: not specified."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010227> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "start timestamp"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010227> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A date value specification that records the start time of a process step."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010227> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "The start timestamp of a sorting step in a recycling batch process."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010228
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010228> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010228> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0001044> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010228> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Expected value datatype: xsd:dateTime; expected unit: not specified."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010228> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "end timestamp"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010228> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A date value specification that records the end time of a process step."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010228> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "The end timestamp of a washing step in a recycling batch process."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010229
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010229> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010229> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020133> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010229> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Expected value datatype: xsd:float; expected unit: kg."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010229> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "input net mass"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010229> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A mass quality that quantifies the net mass entering a process step."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010229> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Input net mass of 10.0 kg for a recycling process step."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010230
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010230> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010230> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020133> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010230> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Expected value datatype: xsd:float; expected unit: kg."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010230> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "output net mass"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010230> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A mass quality that quantifies the net mass leaving a process step."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010230> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Output net mass of 9.5 kg after a recycling process step."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010231
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010231> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010231> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000016> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010231> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "remanufacturability"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010231> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A disposition of a product or component to be restored through remanufacturing to a specified performance or quality state."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010231> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A starter motor assessed as remanufacturable after inspection."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010232
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010232> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010232> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000016> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010232> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "refurbishability"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010232> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A disposition of a product or component to be restored through refurbishment to an acceptable use state."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010232> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A body control module assessed as refurbishable after testing."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010233
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010233> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
