<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010233> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "restricted heavy metals"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010233> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A material entity aggregate comprising heavy metal substances whose concentration is restricted by a stated regulation or standard."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010233> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Lead, mercury, cadmium, and hexavalent chromium considered in ELV compliance."@en .
# 
