<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010234> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A data item that records whether lead concentration complies with a stated threshold."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010234> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A true value indicating that lead concentration is below the applicable threshold."@en .
