<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010235> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A data item that records whether mercury concentration complies with a stated threshold."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010235> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A true value indicating that mercury concentration is below the applicable threshold."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010236
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010236> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
