<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010236> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A data item that records whether cadmium concentration complies with a stated threshold."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010236> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A false value indicating that cadmium concentration exceeds the applicable threshold."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010237
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010237> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010237> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000027> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010237> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Expected value datatype: xsd:boolean; expected unit: not specified."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010237> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "hexavalent chromium threshold compliance"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010237> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A data item that records whether hexavalent chromium concentration complies with a stated threshold."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010237> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A true value indicating that hexavalent chromium concentration is below the applicable threshold."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010238
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010238> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
