<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010238> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Expected value datatype: xsd:string; expected unit: not specified."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010238> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "required tool and software"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010238> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A directive information entity that specifies tools and software required for disassembly, testing, treatment, or reuse assessment."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010238> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A list requiring a diagnostic application and a puller tool for proper disassembly."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010239
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010239> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010239> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000030> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010239> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "component position"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010239> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "position"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010239> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An information content entity that records the position of a component within a product or vehicle."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010239> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Front left door recorded as the component position within a vehicle."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010240
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010240> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010240> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000019> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010240> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Expected value datatype: xsd:integer; expected unit: count."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010240> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "component quantity"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010240> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "quantity"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010240> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A quality that quantifies how many instances of a component occur in a product or vehicle."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010240> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Four identical door speakers recorded as a component quantity."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010241
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010241> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010241> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000019> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010241> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Expected value datatype: xsd:integer; expected unit: km."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010241> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "expected mileage"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010241> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A quality that quantifies the expected travel distance over which a component can perform its intended function."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010241> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Expected mileage of 200000 km for a vehicle component."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010242
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010242> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010242> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000030> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010242> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "design feedback information"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010242> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "feedback to design"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010242> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An information content entity that records dismantling, reuse, repair, or recycling observations for later design improvement."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010242> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Feedback that a bonded joint should be replaced by a reversible fastening for easier dismantling."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010243
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010243> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010243> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0020000> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010243> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Expected value datatype: xsd:string; expected unit: not specified."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010243> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "waste code"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010243> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An identifier that classifies a waste material or waste-containing part according to a stated waste code system."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010243> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A European List of Waste code assigned to a dismantled material fraction."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010244
