<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010244> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "dismantling characteristics information"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010244> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "dismantling information characteristics"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010244> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An information content entity that records product or component characteristics relevant to dismantling."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010244> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A dismantling characteristics record containing position, quantity, and expected mileage."@en .
