# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010266
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010266> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010266> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000030> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010266> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "usage data"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010266> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An information content entity that records service life, load, environmental, status, or incident data observed during product or component use."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010266> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A usage data record containing component age, load spectrum, incidents, and service life estimates."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010267
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010267> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010267> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000019> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010267> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "component status"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010267> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A quality of a component that records its functional, operational, or lifecycle state during use or assessment."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010267> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "In service, failed, removed, repaired, or reused as a component status."@en .
