# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010268
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010268> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010268> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000202> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010268> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "component age in use"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010268> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "age of component"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010268> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A temporal interval that extends from a stated component use event to a stated observation event."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010268> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Age of a component calculated from installation date to dismantling date."@en .
