# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010269
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010269> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010269> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000027> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010269> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Expected value datatype: xsd:string; expected unit: not specified."@en .
