<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010362> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Expected value datatype: xsd:string."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010362> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "product hierarchy node"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010362> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An identifier that denotes the product hierarchy class to which a material is assigned."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010362> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "The product hierarchy code 0846194007 of a belt tensioner."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010363
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010363> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010363> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0020000> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010363> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Expected value datatype: xsd:string."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010363> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "material group"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010363> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An identifier that denotes the material group, or commodity class, to which a material belongs."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010363> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A material group code grouping metal stamping parts."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010364
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010364> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010364> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0020000> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010364> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Expected value datatype: xsd:string."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010364> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "product segment"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010364> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An identifier that denotes the functional product segment of a material."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010364> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "The segment 020000 Belt Tensioner of a material."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010365
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010365> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010365> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020133> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010365> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "gross mass"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010365> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A mass of a material entity that includes the mass of its packaging."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010365> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "The gross mass of one packaged component."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010366
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010366> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010366> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020133> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010366> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "net mass"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010366> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A mass of a material entity that excludes the mass of its packaging."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010366> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "The net mass of one unpackaged component."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010367
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010367> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010367> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0001930> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010367> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "procurement type specification"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010367> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A categorical value specification that states whether a material is produced in-house or procured externally."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010367> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A procurement type whose value E denotes in-house production."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010368
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010368> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010368> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0001931> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010368> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "unit conversion factor"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010368> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A scalar value specification that states the factor for converting a quantity of a material from its base unit to another unit."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010368> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A factor of one kilogram per piece for a component."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010369
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010369> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010369> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000833> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010369> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "routing operation"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010369> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "production operation"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010369> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A manufacturing process that constitutes one step of a production routing and is performed at a work center."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010369> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Operation 0010, the packaging step of a belt tensioner routing."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010370
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010370> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010370> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000027> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010370> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "work center"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010370> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An object aggregate of machines, equipment, or workers that provides production capacity and at which routing operations are performed."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010370> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "An assembly work center comprising the machines and operators that join a belt tensioner."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010371
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010371> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010371> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0001931> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010371> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "standard value"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010371> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A scalar value specification that states a planned standard quantity of a routing operation for a given activity type, such as a setup, machine, or labour time."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010371> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A planned machine time of thirty seconds for an assembly operation."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010372
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010372> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010372> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0001930> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010372> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "activity type"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010372> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A categorical value specification that classifies a standard value of a routing operation by the kind of activity it quantifies, such as machine, labour, or setup."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010372> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "An activity type that classifies a standard value as labour time."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010373
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010373> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010373> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000030> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010373> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "routing operation record"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010373> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An information content entity that is about a routing operation and records its operation number, control key, and work center."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010373> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "The routing record of operation 0010 with its control key and standard values."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010374
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010374> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010374> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000030> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010374> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "approved supplier assignment"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010374> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "source list entry"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010374> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An information content entity that is about a material and a supplier and records that the supplier is approved to provide that material."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010374> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A source list entry recording that supplier SHS is approved to provide a component."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0020000
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0020000> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0020000> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0001933> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0020000> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "estimated carbon footprint value"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0020000> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "estimated carbon footprint value represents a CO2 footprint of a process which is a candiate for the R-strategy. Based on values of different process, an R-strategy decision is met."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0020001
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0020001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0020001> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000027> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0020001> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R-strategy decision dataset"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0020001> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "R-strategy decision dataset is a data item which has estimated carbon footprint values as its members"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0020002
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0020002> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0020002> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000583> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0020002> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "estimation for R-strategy"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0020002> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "estimation for R-strategy is a computing process which outputs estimated values of CO2 footprint for potential reuse, recycle, and remanufacturing processes."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0020003
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0020003> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0020003> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000583> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0020003> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "decision for R-stategy"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0020003> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "decision for R-stategy is a copmuting process in which the decision on whether the product will the recycled, reused, or remanufactured is made based on the estimated values of CO2 for every possible process, material dismantablity, and other parameters."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030000
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030000> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030000> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000967> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030000> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Expected value datatype: xsd:float; expected unit: degC."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030000> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "melt temperature"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030000> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A temperature quality that inheres in polymer melt material at a specified point or interval in a manufacturing process."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030000> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A melt temperature of 280 degC specified for processing PA66-GF25."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030001
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030001> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030000> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030001> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030002> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030001> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Expected value datatype: xsd:float; expected unit: degC."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030001> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "maximum melt temperature"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030001> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A melt temperature that specifies the upper allowed or observed temperature of input melt in a manufacturing process."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030001> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A maximum melt temperature of 290 degC in an injection molding process window."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030002
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030002> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030002> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030000> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030002> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Expected value datatype: xsd:float; expected unit: degC."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030002> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "minimum melt temperature"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030002> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A melt temperature that specifies the lower allowed or observed temperature of input melt in a manufacturing process."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030002> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A minimum melt temperature of 270 degC in an injection molding process window."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030003
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030003> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030003> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000967> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030003> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Expected value datatype: xsd:float; expected unit: degC."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030003> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "mold temperature"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030003> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A temperature quality that inheres in a mold during a manufacturing process."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030003> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A mold temperature of 90 degC specified for processing a glass-fiber-reinforced polyamide."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030004
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030004> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030004> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030003> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030004> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030005> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030004> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Expected value datatype: xsd:float; expected unit: degC."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030004> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "maximum mold temperature"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030004> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A mold temperature that specifies the upper allowed or observed temperature of a mold during a manufacturing process."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0030004> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A maximum mold temperature of 100 degC in an injection molding process window."@en .
