<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000110> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "geological process"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000110> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A natural process that operates within the Earth system to transform, transport, or deform Earth materials, thereby changing Earth structures and landforms"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000503
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000503> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000503> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ASTM-Korngröße"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000503> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "OBSOLETE ASTM grainsize"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000503> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecated> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000503> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Die ASTM-Korngröße ist eine Qualität, die durch ein Verfahren gemessen wird, das dem ASTM-Standard folgt."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000503> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The ASTM grain size is a quality that is measured through a process that follows the ASTM standard."@en .
