# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000512
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000512> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000512> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Make bearer entity member of subclass of 'portion of matter in aggregate state'" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000512> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DEPRECATED Aggregatzustand"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000512> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DEPRECATED aggregate state"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000512> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecated> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000512> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "DEPRECATED a quality representing the physical state of a material, such as solid, liquid, or gasous"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000512> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "DEPRECATED eine intensive Qualität, die den physikalischen Zustand eines Materials darstellt, z. B. fest, flüssig oder gasförmig"@de .
