# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000519
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000519> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000519> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000015> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000519> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Fluss elektrischer Ladung"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000519> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "flow of electric charge"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000519> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "is the process of movement of charged particles"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000519> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "ist der Prozess der Bewegung geladener Teilchen"@de .
