<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000524> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Assemblierungsprozess"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000524> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "assembling process"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000524> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An assembling process is a manufacturing process that mounts or demounts components."@en .
