<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000596> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "deformation"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000596> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "a process that changes the 'dimension quality' of a participant. It excludes translations and rotations."@en .
