<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020128> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A thermodynamic system is a material entity whose parts are bearer of thermodynamic properties. A thermodynamic system environs a thermodynamic process by which the thermodynamic properties of the objects of the thermodynamic system change over time."@en .
