<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020150> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Volumen"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020150> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "volume"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020150> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Volume is a three dimensional size."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020150> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Volumen ist eine dreidimensionale Größe."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020150> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A cylindrical billet has a volume of 0.002 m3, determined from its radius and height"@en .
