# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020288
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020288> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020288> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020287> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020288> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Make entity member of subclass of 'portion of matter in aggregate state'" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020288> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "atom gas"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020288> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "a portion of matter in an gaseous aggregate state where the gas entities are atoms"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020289
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020289> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020289> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020287> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020289> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "gas"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020289> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "a portion of matter in an gaseous aggregate state where the gas entities have no bonds"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020290
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020290> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
