<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020290> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "liquid"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020290> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "a portion of matter in an liquid aggregate state where the liquid's entities transmit no shear stress"@en .
