<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020291> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "mesomorphic"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020291> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "a portion of matter in an mesomorphic aggregate state where some entities transmit no shear stress while others do"@en .
