# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025003
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025003> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025003> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "ferrite, austenite, martensite, etc."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025003> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "OBSOLETE metallic grain structure"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025003> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "metallische Kornstruktur"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025003> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecated> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025003> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "intensive Qualität, die die unterschiedlichen Phasen in der mikroskopischen Struktur eines metallischen Materials verkörpert."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025003> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "intensive quality epitomizing the distinct phases in the microscopic structure of a metallic material."@en .
