<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080022> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "electric charge"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080022> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "elektrische Ladung"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080022> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Electric charge refers to the physical property of matter causing it to experience a force when placed in an electromagnetic field"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080022> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A capacitor stores 10 µC of electric charge at a voltage of 5 V"@en .
