<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080050> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "SI unit: joules per kelvin (J/K)\n\nStatistical definition (Boltzmann):\nS=k_B ln(W)\nwhere k_B​ is the Boltzmann constant and W is the number of microstates."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080050> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "entropy"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080050> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Entropy is a measure of the disorder or randomness of a system — more precisely, the number of microscopic arrangements (microstates) consistent with the system's macroscopic state."@en .
