<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020019> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Bravais-Gitter kubisch flächenzentriert"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020019> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "OBSOLETE bravais lattice cubic face-centered"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020019> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecated> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020019> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Kubisches Bravais-Gitter mit flächenzentrierter Zentrierung (cF), mit vier dreizähligen Rotationsachsen und zusätzlichen Gitterpunkten in den Mittelpunkten aller Flächen"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020019> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "cubic Bravais lattice with face-centered centering (cF), having four 3-fold rotation axes and additional lattice points at the centers of all faces"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020027
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020027> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020027> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Bainit"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020027> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "OBSOLETE bainite"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020027> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecated> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020027> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Eisen-Kohlenstoff-Mikrostruktur, die durch isotherme Umwandlung von Austenit bei Temperaturen zwischen dem Perlit- und Martensitbildungsbereich entsteht und aus Ferrit und fein verteiltem Zementit besteht"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020027> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "iron-carbon microstructure formed by isothermal transformation of austenite at temperatures between the pearlite and martensite formation ranges, consisting of ferrite and finely dispersed cementite"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020097
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020097> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020097> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Austenit"@de .
