<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020109> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "lamellar eutectoid microstructure of alternating ferrite and cementite layers formed by decomposition of austenite at the eutectoid temperature of 723 °C"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020110
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020110> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
