<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020217> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020216> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020217> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Use appropriate class from crystall ontology instead" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020217> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DEPRECATED short range order"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020217> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecated> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020217> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "DEPRECATED periodic arrangement of structural features up to a few entities"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020217> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "DEPRECATED periodische Anordnung von Strukturmerkmalen bis hin zu wenigen Einheiten"@de .
