<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020218> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DEPRECATED medium range order"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020218> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecated> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020218> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "DEPRECATED periodic arrangement of structural features of many entities"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020218> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "DEPRECATED periodische Anordnung struktureller Merkmale vieler Entitäten"@de .
# 
