<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020219> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecated> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020219> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "DEPRECATED periodic arrangement of structural features of virtually all entities"@en .
